  "en": {
    "kind": "Song cycle",
    "about": [
      "A song cycle Theodorakis wrote in 1959–61 to lyrics by Gatsos, Elytis, Christodoulou, Kokkinopoulos and Giannis Theodorakis (plus one of his own). It was recorded in October 1960 at Columbia studio with engineer Nikos Kanellopoulos; the cover is by Bost.",
      "There are two versions: the first with Grigoris Bithikotsis, Manolis Chiotis, Kaiti Thymi and Antonis Kleidonaris, and the second with Mary Linda and an orchestra of winds and strings. In 1976 the two versions were gathered into a 12-song LP. The work is counted among the composer's first entechno popular cycles after Epitafios."
    ]
